{
  "bodyHash": "d2692c434e189a64",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC7sSiQ.png\" width=\"408\" height=\"108\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;color:#000\"><strong>Delightful</strong> — это аддон для <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmer's Delight</a>, добавляющий атмосферный контент с упором на совместимость. Каждая новая функция настраивается.</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/smore.png\" alt=\"S&#x27;more\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></strong></span><strong>&nbsp;</strong><strong>Еда:</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/marshmallow_stick.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Маршмеллоу на палочке</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/cooked_marshmallow_stick.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Жареное маршмеллоу на палочке</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/smore.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Смар</strong> (рекомендуется использовать с <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/neapolitan\" rel=\"nofollow\">Neapolitan</a> или <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a>)</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/sinigang.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;<strong>Синиганг</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/cheeseburger.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Чизбургер</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/deluxe_cheeseburger.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Делюкс чизбургер</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/jelly_bottle.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Банка варенья</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/glow_jelly_bottle.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Банка светящегося варенья</strong> (эффект свечения)</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/nut_butter_bottle.png\" alt=\"Nut Butter Bottle\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Бутылка ореховой пасты</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/nut_butter_and_jelly_sandwich.png\" alt=\"Nut Butter and Jelly Sandwich\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Сэндвич с ореховой пастой и вареньем</strong><strong><br></strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/ender_nectar.png\" alt=\"Ender Nectar\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Нектар Эндера</strong> (одноразовый доступ к сундуку Эндера)<strong><br></strong></li>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/cactus_flesh.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;<strong>Мякоть кактуса</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/cactus_steak.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Стейк из кактуса</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/field_salad.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Полевой салат</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/acorn.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Жёлудь</strong> (орех, выпадающий из дубовых листьев)</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/rock_candy.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><strong>&nbsp;Сахарный кристалл</strong> (для тега \"forge:gems/rose_quartz\", рекомендуется с <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a> или&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomes-o-plenty\" rel=\"nofollow\">Biomes O' Plenty</a></strong>)</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/raw_goat.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;<strong>Сырая козлятина</strong> (выпадает с коз)</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/cooked_goat.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;<strong>Жареная козлятина</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/venison_chops.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Сырые олениные отбивные</strong> (для тега \"forge:raw_venison\", рекомендуется с <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/naturalist\" rel=\"nofollow\">Naturalist</a>)</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/cooked_venison_chops.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;<strong>Жареные олениные отбивные</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/cantaloupe_slice.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Кусок канталупы</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/InventivetalentDev/minecraft-assets/1.19.2/assets/minecraft/textures/item/pumpkin_pie.png\">&nbsp;Полная переработка тыквенного пирога</strong> (настраивается):</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/block/pumpkin_pie_top.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Теперь вы можете размещать обычный тыквенный пирог в мире так же, как пирог из Farmer's Delight!</p>\n<p>Разрежьте пирог, чтобы получить <strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/pumpkin_pie_slice.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Кусочек тыквенного пирога</strong>, или просто кликните правой кнопкой мыши, чтобы съесть его.</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/copper_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></strong></span><strong>&nbsp;</strong><strong>Ножи</strong><strong>:</strong></span></p>\n\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong><em>Ножи должны быть включены в конфигурационном файле по пути \"config/delightful-common.toml\".</em></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/copper_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> Медный нож</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/bone_knife.png\" alt=\"Костяной нож\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Костяной нож</strong> (рекомендуется с модом <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bone-equipment\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bone Equipment</a>)</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/amethyst_knife.png\" alt=\"Аметистовый нож\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Аметистовый нож</strong> (рекомендуется с модом <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/amethyst-equipment\" rel=\"nofollow\">Amethyst Equipment</a>)</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/emerald_knife.png\" alt=\"Изумрудный нож\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Изумрудный нож</strong> (рекомендуется с модом <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/exlines-emerald-equipment\" rel=\"nofollow\">Emerald Equipment</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Совместимые ножи</strong>&nbsp;(тег)<strong>:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/tin_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></strong><strong> Оловянный нож</strong> (forge:ingots/tin)</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/steel_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Стальной нож</strong> (forge:ingots/steel)</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/bronze_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Бронзовый нож</strong> (forge:ingots/bronze)</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/silver_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Серебряный нож</strong> (forge:ingots/silver)</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/brass_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Латунный нож</strong> (forge:ingots/brass)</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/enderite_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Эндеритовый нож</strong>(forge:ingots/enderite)</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/black_opal_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Чёрный опаловый нож</strong>&nbsp;(forge:gems/black_opal)</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/constantan_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Константановый нож</strong>&nbsp;(forge:ingots/constantan)</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/electrum_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Электрумовый нож</strong>&nbsp;(forge:ingots/electrum)</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/invar_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Инваровый нож</strong>&nbsp;(forge:ingots/invar)</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/lead_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Свинцовый нож</strong>&nbsp;(forge:ingots/lead)</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/nickel_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Никелевый нож</strong>&nbsp;(forge:ingots/nickel)</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/zinc_knife.png\" alt=\"Цинковый нож\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Цинковый нож</strong>&nbsp;(forge:ingots/zinc)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Для&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Aether</a> и дополнений:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.20.1/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/skyroot_knife.png\">&nbsp;<strong>Скайрутовый нож</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.20.1/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/holystone_knife.png\">&nbsp;Голокаменный нож</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.20.1/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/zanite_knife.png\">&nbsp;Занитовый нож</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.20.1/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/gravitite_knife.png\">&nbsp;Гравититовый нож</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.20.1/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/skyjade_knife.png\">&nbsp;Скайжадовый нож</strong> (для&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deep-aether\" rel=\"nofollow\">Deep Aether</a></strong>)</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.20.1/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/stratus_knife.png\">&nbsp;Стратусовый нож</strong> (для&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deep-aether\" rel=\"nofollow\">Deep Aether</a></strong>)</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.20.1/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/veridium_knife.png\">&nbsp;<strong>Веридиевый нож</strong> (для&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether-redux\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Aether: Redux</a></strong>)</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.20.1/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/infused_veridium_knife.png\">&nbsp;<strong>Обогащённый веридиевый нож</strong> (для&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether-redux\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Aether: Redux</a></strong>)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Для&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Twilight Forest</a>:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/fiery_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;Огненный нож</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/ironwood_knife.png\">&nbsp;Железноедревесный нож</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/knightmetal_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Рыцарский металлический нож</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/steeleaf_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Сталелистовый нож</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Для&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-undergarden\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Undergarden</a>:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://github.com/brnbrd/Delightful/blob/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/cloggrum_knife.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Клоггрумовый нож\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Клоггрумовый нож</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://github.com/brnbrd/Delightful/blob/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/forgotten_knife.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Забытый нож\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Забытый нож</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://github.com/brnbrd/Delightful/blob/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/froststeel_knife.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Морозностальной нож\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Морозностальной нож</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://github.com/brnbrd/Delightful/blob/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/utherium_knife.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Утериевый нож\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Утериевый нож</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Для&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism-tools\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mekanism Tools</a>:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/osmium_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Осмиевый нож</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/lapis_lazuli_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Лазуритовый нож</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/refined_glowstone_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Рафинированный светопыльный нож</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/refined_obsidian_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Рафинированный обсидиановый нож</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Для&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/botania\" rel=\"nofollow\">Botania</a>&nbsp;и&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mythicbotany\" rel=\"nofollow\">MythicBotany</a>:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://github.com/brnbrd/Delightful/blob/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/elementium_knife.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Элементиумовый нож\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Элементиумовый нож</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://github.com/brnbrd/Delightful/blob/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/manasteel_knife.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Манастальный нож\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Манастальный нож</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://github.com/brnbrd/Delightful/blob/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/terra_knife.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Терра-нож\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Терра-нож</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://github.com/brnbrd/Delightful/blob/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/alf_knife.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Альф-нож\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Альф-нож</strong> (для&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mythicbotany\" rel=\"nofollow\">MythicBotany</a></strong>)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Для&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forbidden-arcanus\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forbidden and Arcanus</a>:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/deorum_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><strong> Деорумовый нож</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/reinforced_deorum_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Усиленный деорумовый нож</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/draco_arcanus_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Драко Арканус нож</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Для&nbsp;</strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-stuff-additions\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Stuff &amp; Additions</a><strong>:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-stuff-additions\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/gilded_quartz_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></a><strong> Позолоченный кварцевый нож</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/experience_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Нож опыта</strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-stuff-additions\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/blazing_knife.png\" alt=\"Пылающий нож\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></a>Пылающий нож</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Для&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simpleores\" rel=\"nofollow\">SimpleOres</a>:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/adamantium_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Адамантитовый нож</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/mythril_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Мифриловый нож</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/onyx_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Ониксовый нож</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Для&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fusion\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fusion</a>:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/thyrium_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Тириевый нож</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/sinisite_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Синизитовый нож</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Для&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-additions-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">Additional Additions</a>:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://github.com/brnbrd/Delightful/blob/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/rose_gold_knife.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Нож из розового золота\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Нож из розового золота</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://github.com/brnbrd/Delightful/blob/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/gilded_netherite_knife.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Позолоченный незеритовый нож\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Позолоченный незеритовый нож</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Для&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/phantasm\" rel=\"nofollow\">End's Phantasm</a>:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/crystalline_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Кристаллический нож</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/stellium_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Стеллиевый нож</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Для <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ores-above-diamonds\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ores Above Diamonds</a>:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/amethyst_knife.png\">&nbsp;Аметистовый нож</strong><strong><br></strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/netherite_opal_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Незеритовый опаловый нож</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Отдельные ножи:</strong><strong><br></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/adamantite_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Адамантитовый нож</strong> (для&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enlightend\" rel=\"nofollow\">Enlightend</a>)</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/living_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Живой нож</strong> (для&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roots-classic\" rel=\"nofollow\">Roots Classic</a></strong>)</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/warden_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Нож Вардена</strong> (для&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deeperdarker\" rel=\"nofollow\">Deeper and Darker</a></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deeperdarker\" rel=\"nofollow\">)</a></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/obsidian_infused_enderite_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Обсидиано-насыщенный эндеритовый нож</strong> (для <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enderite-lieonlion\" rel=\"nofollow\">LieOnLion's Enderite</a>)</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tgwrFK3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><strong> Нож из стали душ</strong>&nbsp;(для&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spirit\" rel=\"nofollow\">Spirit</a>)</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://github.com/brnbrd/Delightful/blob/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/necronium_knife.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Некрониумовый нож\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><strong> Некрониумовый нож</strong> (для&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/phantasmic\" rel=\"nofollow\">Phantasmic</a>)</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/allthemodium_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Нож из аллтемодеума</strong> (для&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/allthemodium\" rel=\"nofollow\">Allthemodium</a></strong>)</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/leaf_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><strong> Листовой нож</strong> (для&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/seeds\" rel=\"nofollow\">Seeds</a>)</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/kiwano_knife.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><strong> Нож из кивано</strong> (для&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nethers-exoticism\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nether's Exoticism</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/salmonberries.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong><strong>Лососевые ягоды</strong><strong>:</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/salmonberries.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Лососевые ягоды</strong> — это вкусная новая ягода, которая встречается в лесах. Они полезны как перекус на ходу или в рецептах, требующих ягоды, например в&nbsp;<strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/berry_matcha_latte.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Матча-латте с ягодами</strong>.</p>\n<p>Они являются особенным ингредиентом для&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/salmonberry_pie.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><strong> Лососевого пирога</strong> (который можно&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/salmonberry_pie_slice.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;нарезать на ломтики) и&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/salmonberry_ice_cream.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><strong> Лососевого мороженого</strong> (рекомендуется с модом&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/neapolitan\" rel=\"nofollow\">Neapolitan</a>).</p>\n<p>Из ягод можно скрафтить&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/salmonberry_pips.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;<strong>Семена лососевой ягоды</strong> и посадить их (вдохновлено модом <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/berry-good\" rel=\"nofollow\">Berry Good</a>).</p>\n<p>Однако кусты <strong>Лососевой ягоды</strong> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">требуют дождя и освещения</span> для быстрого роста.</p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/block/salmonberry_sack.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Мешок лососевой ягоды</strong> — это блок для хранения и декора ваших ягод (вдохновлён модом&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quark\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quark</a>).</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/matcha.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong><strong>Матча</strong><strong>:</strong></span></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/green_tea_leaf.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Листья зелёного чая</strong>&nbsp;можно получить, используя нож на блоках листьев (с определённой вероятностью). Листья зелёного чая из&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-respite\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmer's Respite</a>&nbsp;совместимы и рекомендуются.</p>\n<p>Их можно приготовить в котшке до состояния&nbsp;<strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/matcha.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Матчи</strong> — концентрированного чайного порошка.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Затем его можно использовать для приготовления двух вкусных напитков латте с эффектами:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/matcha_latte.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Матча-латте</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/berry_matcha_latte.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Ягодный матча-латте</strong><strong><br></strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/matcha_ice_cream.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Матча-мороженое</strong> (рекомендуется с модом&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/neapolitan\" rel=\"nofollow\">Neapolitan</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/animal_fat.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Жир и масло животных:</span><br></strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/animal_fat.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;<strong>Животный жир</strong> выпадает из любых «жирных» животных (с тегом \"delightful:fatty_animals\") с определённой вероятностью. Включена поддержка совместимости с другими модами.</p>\n<p>Жир можно переработать в&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/animal_oil_bottle.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;<strong>Бутылки животного масла</strong>, которые являются топливом для печи со специальной способностью: простое нажатие ПКМ с зажатой Shift мгновенно пополнит запасы топлива в печи.</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/block/basalt_cabinet_front.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></span>&nbsp;Блоки:<br></strong></span></strong></strong></strong></strong></strong></strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/block/acorn_sack.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><strong>&nbsp;Мешок желудей</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/eVJANTM.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Мини-арбуз</strong> (появляется на равнинах)</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/block/cantaloupe_side_small.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Канталупа</strong>&nbsp;(появляется на пляжах)</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/block/quartz_cabinet_front.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> &nbsp;Кварцевый шкаф</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/block/basalt_cabinet_front.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> &nbsp;Базальтовый шкаф</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/246/22/637155296232619409.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;<strong>Для&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oh-the-biomes-youll-go\" rel=\"nofollow\">Oh The Biomes You'll Go</a>:</strong></span></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AOCAWOL/BYG/1.19.X/Common/src/main/resources/assets/byg/textures/item/blueberry_pie.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AOCAWOL/BYG/1.19.X/Common/src/main/resources/assets/byg/textures/item/green_apple_pie.png\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AOCAWOL/BYG/1.19.X/Common/src/main/resources/assets/byg/textures/item/nightshade_berry_pie.png\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AOCAWOL/BYG/1.19.X/Common/src/main/resources/assets/byg/textures/item/crimson_berry_pie.png\">&nbsp;Переработка пирогов</strong> (отключите любой предмет ломтика, чтобы выключить):</p>\n<p>(рекомендуется с текстурпаком&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/pie-overhaul-delightful-retextured\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pie Overhaul</a>)</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/block/blueberry_pie_top.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/block/green_apple_pie_top.png\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/block/nightshade_berry_pie_top.png\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/block/crimson_berry_pie_top.png\">&nbsp;Теперь вы можете размещать любые пироги из <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Oh The Biomes You'll Go</span> в мире так же, как пироги из <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Farmer's Delight</span>!</p>\n<p>Разрежьте пирог, чтобы получить&nbsp;<strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/blueberry_pie_slice.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/green_apple_pie_slice.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/nightshade_berry_pie_slice.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/crimson_berry_pie_slice.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Ломтик пирога</strong>, или просто нажмите ПКМ, чтобы съесть. Пирог даст тот же эффект зелья, что и раньше.</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/565/915/637924211543296813.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;<strong>Для&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-nouveau\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ars Nouveau</a>:</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/baileyholl/Ars-Nouveau/1.19.x/src/main/resources/assets/ars_nouveau/textures/items/source_berry_pie.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Переработка пирогов из ягод источника</strong> (отключите предмет ломтика, чтобы выключить):</p>\n<p>(рекомендуется с текстурпаком&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/pie-overhaul-delightful-retextured\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pie Overhaul</a>)</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/block/source_berry_pie_top.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Теперь вы можете размещать пирог из ягод источника из <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Ars Nouveau</span> в мире так же, как пирог из <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Farmer's Delight</span>!</p>\n<p>Разрежьте пирог, чтобы получить&nbsp;<strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/source_berry_pie_slice.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Ломтик пирога из ягод источника</strong>, или просто нажмите ПКМ, чтобы съесть. Пирог даст тот же эффект зелья, что и раньше.</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/field_salad.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></strong></span><strong>&nbsp;</strong><strong>Для <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomes-o-plenty\" rel=\"nofollow\">Biomes O' Plenty</a></strong><strong>:</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/chopped_clover.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Нарезанный клевер</strong><strong><br></strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/lavender_tea.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Лавандовый чай</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/483/128/637782721029825410.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></strong></span><strong>&nbsp;</strong><strong>Для </strong><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ecologics\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ecologics</a></strong><strong>:</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brdle/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/coconut_curry.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;<strong>Кокосовое карри</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/honey_glazed_walnut.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Грецкий орех в мёде</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/prickly_pear_juice.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Сок опунции</strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/brnbrd/Delightful/1.19.2/src/main/resources/assets/delightful/textures/item/azalea_tea.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;Азалиевый чай</strong><strong><br></strong></li>\n</ul>\n</div>",
